```mdl
verdict F-1.1: One DecisionModel.decide call per message asks needs-reply, urgency and label together.
  status: done
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-labeler/src/questions.ts#labelQuestions, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-labeler/src/operations/label-mailbox.ts]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-labeler/src/questions.test.ts, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-labeler/src/operations/label-mailbox.test.ts]
```

```mdl
verdict F-1.2: The choice criteria are the space's user tags keyed by URI, plus a "none" option.
  status: untested
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-labeler/src/operations/label-mailbox.ts, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-labeler/src/questions.ts#labelQuestions, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-labeler/src/questions.ts#NO_LABEL]
  note: |
    Tags are filtered with `Tag.isUserTag`. Tests cover the user-tag criteria and the "none" choice, but no test seeds a
    canonical or provider tag to show it is excluded.
```

```mdl
verdict F-1.3: With no user tags the handler asks TriageQuestions, which omit the label question.
  status: untested
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-labeler/src/questions.ts#TriageQuestions, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-labeler/src/operations/label-mailbox.ts]
  note: Both tests seed a "Billing" tag, so the no-tags branch never runs.
```

```mdl
verdict F-1.4: The model sees sender, subject and a snippet of at most 480 characters.
